# modern-keys: from the menu, load the saved game the items session writes; then each of the
# layout's keys once: run, back, slide, turn, pitch, look and use at the pointer, the map and its
# levels, the panels, the compass and flasks, the bag keys, and Space in fight mode (F5)
3000 key enter         # Journey Onward
4500 key enter         # the first saved game
9000 down w
10000 up w
10500 down s
11000 up s
11500 down a
12000 up a
12500 down left
13000 up left
13500 key up
14000 key down
14500 key q
15000 key e
15500 key z
16500 key s
17000 key w
17500 key c
18000 key esc
19000 key r
19500 key f
20000 key f
20500 key g
21000 key h
21500 key v
22000 key b
22500 key c
